{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0066", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "天才交易员 AI 量化十大等待场景——什么时候该先按下暂停？", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 189}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0067", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 10 个，数据异常**：先确认数据，再相信信号。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 191}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0068", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 9 个，规则不明确**：条件没写全，就先不出手。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 192}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0069", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 8 个，信号冲突**：不同模型打架，先核对口径。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 193}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0070", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 7 个，流动性不足**：先评估冲击和成交能力。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 194}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0071", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 6 个，价差过大**：看看价差是不是超出了预设阈值。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 195}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0072", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 5 个，成本过高**：成本优势不足，那就等一等。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 196}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0073", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 4 个，事件风险超出策略范围**：不熟悉的事件，别硬套旧模型。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 197}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0074", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 3 个，仓位已满**：先检查总风险敞口。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 198}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0075", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 2 个，风控触发**：触碰红线就执行暂停。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 199}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0076", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 1 个，情绪失控**：最后要等的是自己的冷静。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 200}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0077", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "等待也是一种决策。我是老木，感谢关注。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 202}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0078", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "天才交易员 AI 量化的十大市场情绪数据：", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 206}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0079", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 10 个，搜索热度**：有人搜，不等于有人买。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 208}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0080", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 9 个，社交讨论量**：讨论突然变多，是扩散还是刷屏？", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 209}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0081", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 8 个，社交情绪**：大家在说什么，比说多少更进一步。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 210}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
{"unit_id": "learn_laomu_notes_0082", "project_id": "laomu_notes", "claim": "- **第 7 个，恐贪指数**：加权标准化指标，先看编制，再看分数。", "evidence": {"file": "20261102_老木创业笔记_交易老木29条视频文案汇编.md", "line": 211}, "status": "draft", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:11:51+08:00"}
